{%- comment -%}
  Hartwick Atelier — Size & Fit, for the panel's accordion row.

  Aloha, 3 September 2026, asks for the longer information in the panel to be
  "organised through restrained accordion rows". Size and fit is one of those
  rows, and it is the one that cannot be a block of typed rich text: the facts
  belong to the garment, not to the theme.

    hartwick.silhouette      Straight, relaxed
    hartwick.fit             Ease through body and sleeve
    hartwick.movement
    hartwick.garment_length
    hartwick.model_height    } the two that make a photograph legible
    hartwick.size_worn       }

  Same rules as every other Hartwick component: a row renders only when its
  field is present, an empty field collapses with no orphaned label, and no
  measurement is invented. `guidance` carries the editable prose that sits
  beneath the rows — Aloha's words, from the theme editor.

  This snippet renders the whole accordion row, not just its contents: the
  `capture` that hands the body to snippets/ha-panel-row.liquid lives here rather
  than in the template, so the `custom_liquid` block that calls it stays a single
  `render` with no control flow in it.

  Usage (inside a main-product custom_liquid block):
    {% render 'ha-fit', title: 'Size & Fit', guidance: '<p>…</p>' %}
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign mf = product.metafields.hartwick
  assign has_rows = false
  if mf.silhouette != blank or mf.fit != blank or mf.movement != blank or mf.garment_length != blank or mf.model_height != blank or mf.size_worn != blank
    assign has_rows = true
  endif
-%}

{%- capture ha_fit_body -%}
  {%- if has_rows -%}
    <table class="ha-record__table ha-record">
      <caption class="visually-hidden">Size and fit</caption>
      <tbody>
        {%- if mf.silhouette != blank -%}
          <tr><th scope="row">Silhouette</th><td>{{ mf.silhouette }}</td></tr>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if mf.fit != blank -%}
          <tr><th scope="row">Fit</th><td>{{ mf.fit }}</td></tr>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if mf.movement != blank -%}
          <tr><th scope="row">Movement</th><td>{{ mf.movement }}</td></tr>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if mf.garment_length != blank -%}
          <tr><th scope="row">Length</th><td>{{ mf.garment_length }}</td></tr>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if mf.model_height != blank -%}
          <tr><th scope="row">Model height</th><td>{{ mf.model_height }}</td></tr>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if mf.size_worn != blank -%}
          <tr><th scope="row">Size worn</th><td>{{ mf.size_worn }}</td></tr>
        {%- endif -%}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if guidance != blank -%}
    <div class="ha-panel-row__prose ha-narrate">{{ guidance }}</div>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- unless has_rows -%}
    {%- render 'ha-placeholder-note',
      show: true,
      text: 'Placeholder — measurements publish from hartwick.silhouette, fit, movement, garment_length, model_height and size_worn'
    -%}
  {%- endunless -%}
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- render 'ha-panel-row', id: 'fit', title: title, content: ha_fit_body -%}
